ss response system, and understanding it is crucial to managing stress effectively."]}],"\n","$L4","\n","$L5","\n","$L6","\n","$L7","\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n","$L64","\n","$L65","\n","$L66","\n","$L67","\n","$L68","\n","$L69"],"$L6a"]}]]}],"$L6b","$L6c"],["$L6d","$L6e"],"$L6f"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
4:["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The Hypothalamus"}]," (your brain's command center) detects the threat"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The Pituitary Gland"}]," releases ACTH (adrenocorticotropic hormone)"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The Adrenal Glands"}]," flood your body with cortisol and adrenaline"]}],"\n"]}]
5:["$","p","p-3",{"children":"This cascade creates the \"fight or flight\" response: your heart races, breathing quickens, muscles tense, and non-essential functions (like digestion and immune response) are temporarily suppressed."}]
6:["$","h3","h3-1",{"children":"When Acute Becomes Chronic"}]
7:["$","p","p-4",{"children":"The problem arises when this system never gets a chance to reset. In chronic stress:"}]
8:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Cortisol levels remain elevated"}]," for weeks, months, or even years"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"The HPA axis becomes dysregulated, either over-responding or under-responding"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"Your body stays in a perpetual state of \"emergency mode\""}],"\n"]}]
9:["$","p","p-5",{"children":"This is like leaving your car's engine running at high RPMs 24/7—eventually, something breaks down."}]
